[05/25 14:54:44     64s] @file 231: # Explanation : We need to add well taps, to bias the bulk of the transistors to the correct potential
[05/25 14:54:44     64s] @file 232: #               According to the documentation, the maximum distance a cell can have to a well tap is 30um.
[05/25 14:54:44     64s] @file 233: #               This means that if we space the well taps with 60um, all cells will be within the 30um range of a tap.
